/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (The main objectives of BankWise AI are:)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 978 0 R
/E (Automate Customer Inquiries: Provide an automated assistant capable of answering common Banque Misr banking inquiries without requiring customers to contact a branch or customer service representative for every routine question.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 979 0 R
/E (Implement Retrieval-Augmented Generation: Develop a RAG pipeline that retrieves relevant information from verified Banque Misr documents and uses the retrieved content to generate contextually accurate responses.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 980 0 R
/E (Provide Reliable Loan Calculations: Implement a deterministic loan calculation and eligibility engine that applies predefined financial rules and mathematical formulas rather than relying on the LLM to perform calculations.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
